# Shared by every Docker build that uses the repository root as context — both the
# root Dockerfile (docs/container.md, docs/ci.md) and the HA add-on
# (privacy_witness_kernel/Dockerfile). Only exclude large/irrelevant paths that NO
# Dockerfile copies. In particular do NOT exclude docs/ or tests/ — the root
# Dockerfile COPYs them. target/ alone is ~13 GB, which is the real problem here.
target/
**/target/
.git/
**/node_modules/
